  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"849\">\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"849\"><strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"781\">CK-10 (Cytokeratin 10)</strong> is a marker of <strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"848\">terminal epidermal keratinocyte differentiation</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"972\">\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"884\">It is typically <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"880\">positive</strong> in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"972\">\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"919\">\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"919\"><strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"919\">Benign squamous epithelium</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"972\">\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"972\">Well-differentiated squamous cell carcinomas</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"991\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"987\">Negative</strong> in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<li data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1037\">\n<p data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1037\">Undifferentiated or non-epithelial tumors</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1067\">Basal layer keratinocytes</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1141\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1141\">Expression pattern supports <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1126\">squamous differentiation</strong> when positive.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
